# Example keystore config for Vikify release builds.
#
# This file is a template only. Never commit real `keystore.properties` or any `.jks`.
#
# Recommended: keep the real keystore.properties OUTSIDE the repository
# (for example at C:\Users\<you>\Desktop\Cursor\VikifyOps\local-config\keystore.properties)
# and expose its absolute path to Gradle via env var:
#
#   set VIKIFY_KEYSTORE_PROPERTIES=C:\full\path\to\keystore.properties
#
# Alternative for CI: set individual env vars instead of using any file:
#   VIKIFY_RELEASE_STORE_FILE
#   VIKIFY_RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD
#   VIKIFY_RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS
#   VIKIFY_RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD
#
# Field semantics: storeFile may be an absolute path (recommended) or relative to repo root (legacy).
#
# Placeholder values — replace with real ones in your copy, which must live OUTSIDE this repo.
storeFile=C:\\absolute\\path\\to\\VikifyOps\\keystore\\vikify-release.jks
storePassword=CHANGE_ME
keyAlias=CHANGE_ME
keyPassword=CHANGE_ME
